  <name>High speed downloader</name>
  <summary>Download and manage files</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      Bengal Download Manager is a lightweight, open-source download manager.
      It features multi-threaded segment acceleration, browser extension
      integration, proxy support, and category organization.
    </p>
  </description>

