                <li>Resolved version display issue in Flatpak and Flathub builds</li>
                <li>Improved application version reporting across packaging formats</li>
                <li>Updated application translations</li>
            </ul>
        </description>
    </release>
    <release version="0.3.0" date="2026-10-21">
        <description>
            <p>Bengal Download Manager 0.3.0 changes:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Assets: Provide PNG format screenshots for AppStream catalog compatibility</li>
                <li>Assets: Update, renumber, and optimize screenshots and feature branding posters</li>
                <li>Options: Disable proxy credentials section when unchecked or unsupported</li>
                <li>Assets: Create high-resolution branding posters for speed, ecosystem, and themes</li>
            </ul>
        </description>
    </release>
    <release version="0.2.99" date="2026-10-20">
        <description>
